{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip/README.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T02:31:40.759924Z","id":"30a57b9ef8955e23ff37b8e58bfe540fddaa63970a06cc0d5bcbdea2a8cb215e","body":{"detail":"jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip has no project.json, so assert_proofs! and jarl/scripts/verify.sh never check it; only build.sh does. step_vote is closed, but the other seven step message kinds (StepCase_<kind>.lean from gen/step_cases.py) still end in sorry, and next_message, build, the world simulation and the implementation-level election-safety theorem are not started. It also covers only the fixed engine (Fixed: hooks absent, peers equal to members).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":26},"end":{"line":29},"content_hash":"2406a25a558e437bdeaa581c34078808f306c08c8710bc833153a6f7e9f9bada"},"suggested_fix":"Close the remaining step cases and their Abs lemmas, prove next_message/build, compose a world simulation onto Jarl.ElectionSafety.Step, then add a project.json with proof_modules so the gate checks it and drop the -wip suffix.","summary":"The Node refinement is ungated and covers only the Vote arm of step","tags":["session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
